SUMMARY:Rise Up: Overcoming Challenges & Finding Inner Strength
DESCRIPTION:“Rise Up Overcoming Challenges and Finding Inner Strength”\nThe Center for Latino Heritage and Spanish Language Excellence (CLaSE)\, the Department of Theatre and Dance at Montclair State University\, and the John J. Cali School of Music at Montclair State University\, in partnership with Montclair Fund for Educational Excellence (MFEE) and the Drew University Theatre Department\, present Rise Up\, a powerful one night showcase of original monologues\, dance\, and music.\nCreated and performed by Latino middle and high school students and members of the Kichwa community\, this bilingual performance uplifts stories of migration\, identity\, and resilience. Through deeply personal work\, these young artists share what it means to overcome and to rise. Join us for an inspiring evening that celebrates culture\, community\, and the strength of finding your voice. Link to RSVP for your FREE tickets | Donations to MFEE are welcome \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/rise-up-overcoming-challenges-finding-inner-strength/
LOCATION:Drew University\, Directing Lab Dorothy Young Arts Center Drew University\, Madison\, New Jersey\, NJ\, 07940\, United States
CATEGORIES:General Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/MFEE-and-CLaSE-center-for-Latino-heritage-and-Spanish-language-Excellence-at-Montclair-State-University-Presents.png
END:VEVENT
