SUMMARY:Rock & Soul Book Signing at Allegory Restaurant with Photographer Barry Morgenstein
DESCRIPTION:Big news! Did you miss the recent Rock & Soul launch event in Arlington\, VA\, or the Rock & Soul Morristown event? Here is another opportunity to attend a great event in Montclair\, NJ\, at the renowned The MC Hotel’s Allegory restaurant & bar.  \nJoin us on Saturday\, April 25th\, from 6pm-9:00pm. Meet Barry Morgenstein and purchase a signed copy of best selling Rock & Soul!  \nInfo on Rock & Soul:\nhttps://www.barrymorgenstein.com/best-seller-book-rock-soul-portrait-photography \nMore info about Rock & Soul\n“Rock & Soul: Portraits by Barry Morgenstein” is a hardcover coffee table book featuring the photographer’s iconic portraits of music legends.\nYou can purchase it from several places:\n• Direct from the author’s website (for signed copies and potential extras like contest entries): https://www.barrymorgenstein.com/product-page/copy-of-rock-amp-soul-portraits-book-of-photography This is Barry’s official store\, priced around $69.95\, and he often promotes signed versions or special offers there.\n• Amazon: https://www.amazon.com/Rock-Soul-Portraits-Barry-Morgenstein/dp/1966786425 It’s listed as a bestseller/top new release in some categories\, with strong reviews.\n• Ballast Books (the publisher): https://www.ballastbooks.com/ballast-bookstore/rock-soul  Direct from the publisher for $69.95.\n• Other major retailers like Barnes & Noble\, Target\, Books-A-Million\, and Walmart also carry it (online and possibly in-store).\n \nThe book was released on November 4\, 2025\, so it’s widely available now. If you’re looking for a signed copy or to support the artist directly\, go through barrymorgenstein.com! \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/rock-soul-book-signing-at-allegory-restaurant-with-photographer-barry-morgenstein/
LOCATION:Allegory Restaurant & Bar\, 690 Bloomfield Ave\, Montclair\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:General Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Rock-Soul-Book-Signing-Flyer-.png
