SUMMARY:Oratorio Society of New Jersey Presents America Inspired!
DESCRIPTION:To honor the 250th anniversary of the signing of the Declaration of Independence\, the Oratorio Society of New Jersey (OSNJ) will perform America Inspired! – a program dedicated to works of a broad range of American composers. The concert will provide a flavor of the rich melting pot of influences that is American music\, including liturgical\, spiritual\, gospel\, jazz\, folk\, and neo-classical. \nThe concert takes place on Saturday\, April 25\, at 7:30 pm\, at Union Congregational Church\, 176 Cooper Avenue\, Montclair. \nAmerica Inspired! will feature choral and instrumental works by some of our country’s greatest composers\, including Samuel Barber\, Leonard Bernstein\, Aaron Copland\, William Dawson\, Duke Ellington\, George Gershwin and Randall Thompson. \nTickets are $30 in advance and $35 at the door – plus OSNJ has introduced student pricing: $15 in advance\, $20 at the door.\nDoors open at 7:00pm for the 7:30pm performance – please arrive early due to General Admission seating. For more information and to purchase tickets online\, visit the Oratorio Society of New Jersey website at https://www.oratoriosocietynj.org/. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/oratorio-society-of-new-jersey-presents-america-inspired/
LOCATION:Union Congregational Church\, 176 Cooper Ave\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07043\, United States
CATEGORIES:Live Music
