SUMMARY:Watchung Booksellers Hosts Judy Blume Biographer Mark Oppenheimer
DESCRIPTION:Watchung Booksellers welcomes Marc Oppenheimer\, author of Judy Blume: A Life on Tuesday\, April 28 at 7:00\, in conversation with author Jay Michaelson. \nIn Judy Blume\, journalist\, historian\, and longtime Blume aficionado Mark Oppenheimer pens a beautiful\, multidimensional portrait of the acclaimed author through extensive interviews with Blume herself\, invaluable access to her papers and correspondence\, and thoughtful analysis of Blume’s beloved novels\, including early\, unpublished works that shed light on the pathbreaking writer she would become. \nTickets are $5 and include a 10% discount on the book purchased at the event. To register\, visit watchungbooksellers.com. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/watchung-booksellers-hosts-judy-blume-biographer-mark-oppenheimer/
